{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D388|D389' docs/DECISIONS-log.md; rg -n '同一题、续期|<h[1-6][\"'^>]*>.*[34]|binding_obligation'\"' docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html\"","aggregated_output":"4172:## D388 · 2026-11-09 · A material unsigned obligation gets its own signing question beside an open total of its kind\n4185:## D389 · 2026-11-09 · An unsigned obligation is large enough for its own signing question at about 5% of the company's annual profit\n4192:- **Decided.** Under D388, a single unsigned obligation is large enough for its own signing question when its stated amount is about 5%\n4196:- **Why.** In the focused D388 call, the same $2bn stake opened in 0 of 3 draws under one wording and 3 of 3 under another, and a\n4201:- **Scope.** It applies to the focused D388 step under test. It enters the clean-arch PRD only if that step is adopted. The frozen\n4212:- **Decided.** Under D388, a programme or plan as a whole counts as undertaken once the item reports a deal signed under it. It is then\n4215:- **Why.** In the focused D388 call, dev-20 turned NVIDIA's announced credit-support model into a signing question in 2 of 3 rounds,\n4218:- **Scope.** It applies to the focused D388 step under test and enters the clean-arch PRD only if that step is adopted. The frozen\n4228:  - **Clean Step 1 is closed on c8 (D387).** The focused D388 call is a tested candidate, not adopted. It opened Ohio in 36 of 36\n4229:    draws, but each round opened one wrong neighbouring case (§§54–58); D389 and D390 apply to it only. The open defects are listed in\n4823:- **Scope:** clean Step 1. Ohio (D388–D391), the second-thing shapes and the other findings of the diagnosis stay recorded, not changed.\n162:<h3>一张图：同一篇文章里每句话的去向</h3>\n207:<h3 id=\"d248\">D248：颗粒度的七条（2026-10-30）</h3>\n222:<h3 id=\"d250\">D250：证据的四条界线和计数单位（2026-10-31）</h3>\n235:<h3 id=\"conventions\">我定的记录约定</h3>\n271:<h2 id=\"types\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>问题的五类：账本的几大类型</h2>\n278:<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>C</b> 约束性义务</td><td><code>binding_obligation</code></td><td>标的</td><td>公司以自己名义承担的：为别人的债务、租约或收入担保或提供信用支持；借钱给别人；承诺购买（向别人买产能或服务也算）；为客户的产能或收入兜底；或写明规模、尚未完成的入股或收购<span class=\"src\">D236；收购按 D243 第 7 条</span>。规模要大到能改变公司的收入、利润、现金或信用风险才开；够不上的单笔入股、收购、租约、授信不开题，陈述留不留照第 5 节判<span class=\"src\">D248 第 6 条</span>。不算：自己借钱、自己的租约、已完成或没写规模的投资。D239 选定的 role-v29 原文：\"Its own borrowing, its own leases and a completed or unsized investment are not obligations\"；D238 的记录写作 \"the company's own borrowing and leases and a completed or unsized stake do not\"</td><td>还没签：是非两档。已经承担（一笔或一个计划）：金额，五档</td><td>检查日最多在文章后 18 个月<span class=\"src\">D185</span>；已承担的按下一份年报</td><td>签约公告、年报承诺附注</td><td>D184、D185、D210、D236、D238、D243</td></tr>\n292:<h3>五类之外的东西去哪</h3>\n300:<h3>问题怎么写：PRD 06 的梯子规则，不重写</h3>\n308:<h2 id=\"opening\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>开题标准</h2>\n310:<p>颗粒度按一个高端对冲基金分析员：只有会单独下注的大事开题，鸡毛蒜皮不开题（它的陈述留不留照第 5 节判）；同一个赌注的几种说法是一题，截止日、里程碑、财年和日历年各按本节\"同一题、续期，还是另一题\"里的那一条判<span class=\"src\">D248</span>。</p>\n313:<h3>四个测试<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6</span></h3>\n327:<h3>不开的<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6 的清单</span></h3>\n343:<h3>同一题、续期，还是另一题：匹配这一步的事，抽取不判库里的</h3>\n358:<h3>谁判，谁查</h3>\n364:<tr><td>和库里的同一题、续期、另一题</td><td>匹配（Jev）和碰撞裁决<span class=\"src\">D190</span>；共同量由代码<span class=\"src\">D197</span></td></tr>\n369:<h3>5.1 留的规则和四类</h3>\n386:<h3>5.2 不完整也是证据</h3>\n389:<h3>5.3 不留的<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §2 的清单，加 D238、D243 的行</span></h3>\n408:<h3>5.4 一条记录必须保住的意思<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §3，原样</span></h3>\n423:<h3>5.5 来源层<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 的四层；D238 采纳的 role-v29 原文</span></h3>\n449:<h3>判法</h3>\n483:<h3>每一条记什么</h3>\n491:<h3>分量的分布（定稿）</h3>\n500:<h3>怎么写成、怎么核的</h3>\n518:<h3>用它之前要知道的</h3>\n529:<h3>9.1 改提示词</h3>\n539:<h3>9.2 测量</h3>\n566:<h3>9.3 迭代：一类一类改</h3>\n640:<h3>三轮独立读者仿真</h3>\n654:<h3>十一轮漂移检查</h3>\n676:<h3>出处</h3>\n679:<h3>文件</h3>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
