ue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c14-system.txt:172:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c15c-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c16-system.txt:95:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c16-system.txt:188:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c15c-system.txt:95:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c15c-system.txt:172:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c15yc-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c18-system.txt:95:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c18-system.txt:176:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/u3-system.txt:159:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/lfile-system.txt:161:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/u1k-system.txt:163:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c15o-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/k6b-system.txt:159:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c1-system.txt:167:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c16-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-system.txt:95:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-system.txt:174:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c14-schema.json:53:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-system.txt:95:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-system.txt:172:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c5-system.txt:166:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c12-system.txt:96:- binding_obligation: an obligation the company takes on in its own name, large enough to change its revenue, profit, cash or credit\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c12-system.txt:173:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/u1u3-system.txt:159:Return the theses and evidence in the supplied response schema, after the closing check at the end of this request. Return empty\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c11-schema.json:54:       \"binding_obligation\",\nclean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c11-schema.json:65:      \"description\": \"For a binding_obligation thesis: what the obligation could change in the company's own revenue, profit, cash or credit risk, judged against the company's size as the item states it, not only against a total of its kind or another deal. Write no figure the item does not give; this field is reasoning, not evidence. When the item gives no measure of the company's size or no amount for the obligation itself, say so and judge qualitatively from what it does state: whom the obligation backs, for what and for how long (the cost of a project or asset is not the obligation's amount). For any other opens_as, null.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
